.cpcache/
.clj-kondo/.cache/
# .lsp/ holds BOTH a cache and tracked config. `.lsp/config.edn` is the
# clojure-lsp gate config (dead-code exclusions) and MUST be committed — the
# `clojure-lsp` check in bin/analyze is blocking, so without this file CI sees
# 350+ unused-public-var findings and fails every run.
.lsp/*
!.lsp/config.edn
.nrepl-port
hs_err_pid*.log
debugging-*.jsonl
.eta-mu
target/

# Coverage / mutation-testing artifacts (config is tracked; caches are not)
.heretic/
.heretic-sandbox/

# Actor runtime data (sessions, inbox, outbox) — definitions tracked, runtime ephemeral
.ημ/actors/*/sessions/
.ημ/actors/*/inbox/
.ημ/actors/*/outbox/
.ημ/.env

# Lockfiles and checkpoints
.#*
.ipynb_checkpoints/
